00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:20.820
I'm just sitting there, I
got three plates right here,

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.630
and I'm just grubbing, you know?

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:23.690
And I ain't even pay two dollars.

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:25.790
I'm just grubbing at myself up.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.500
